# ---- Secrets: never commit any environment file -------------------------
# .env holds APP_KEY, the database password, the Gmail app password, the Google
# OAuth client secret, the M-Pesa consumer key/secret/passkey and the M-Pesa
# callback URL. Only the committed *example* files are safe.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.production.example
.env.backup
.env.backup.*
.env.local
.env.production
*.env

